 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 532528,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Suppose your city has a park just like the one in Example 10.45. The length of each street is 49 yd, and the perpendicular distance between streets is 31 yd. How much sod, sold by the square foot at $0.45 per square foot plus $1.00 per square foot for installation, and a flat $50 fee for equipment, should be purchased and what will the cost be?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "13,671 square feet; cost is $19,872.95."
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>First, convert the dimensions to feet. There are 3 feet in one yard.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"31\\ {\\rm{ }}\\cancel{{{\\rm{yard}}}}\\left( {\\frac{{3{\\rm{\\ feet}}}}{{1{\\rm{\\ }}\\cancel{{{\\rm{yard}}}}}}} \\right) = 93\\ {\\rm{ feet}}\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"49\\ {\\rm{ }}\\cancel{{{\\rm{yard}}}}\\left( {\\frac{{3{\\rm{\\ feet}}}}{{1{\\rm{\\ }}\\cancel{{{\\rm{yard}}}}}}} \\right) = 147\\ {\\rm{ feet}}\"></span></p>\n<p>The area of a parallelogram with base <i>b</i> and height <i>h</i> is <span data-math=\"A = bh\"></span>.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"A = bh = \\left( {{\\rm{93\\ feet}}} \\right)\\left( {{\\rm{147\\ feet}}} \\right) = 13,671\\ {\\rm{ f}}{{\\rm{t}}^2}\"></span></p>\n<p>There are two charges per square foot: $0.45 and $1.00, for a total of $1.45 per square foot.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"13,671\\cancel{{{\\text{f}}{{\\text{t}}^2}}}\\left( {\\frac{{\\$ 1.45}}{{1{\\text{ }}\\cancel{{{\\text{f}}{{\\text{t}}^2}}}}}} \\right) = \\$ 19,822\"></span></p>\n<p>Add the $50 flat fee for equipment.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"{\\text{\\$19,822  +  \\$50  =  \\$19,872}}{\\text{.95}}\"></span></p>\n<p>You will buy 13,671 square feet of sod. The total cost is $19,872.95.</p>\n"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
